amp":1788581415870859001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Local CLI fallback migrated 18/18 selected per-file tickets to grouped replacements; newly closed=18, already closed=0, errors=0.","timestamp":1788581522225998001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Consolidation complete: 1,499 per-file children were mapped once to 114 grouped leaf tickets under 6 workstream stories and closed as superseded. The original epic is superseded and closed. Final audit: 1,499 closed/superseded sources, 1,499 exact live superseders, 1,499 unique file-impact paths, and 121/121 new epic/story/leaf plans passing the deterministic readiness and clarity floor; no invariant failures.","timestamp":1788582102402409001}],"created_at":1788570271406512725,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"dd5c5725-7abb-4bc4-b3d1-8ec48c2c42a4","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"d8a3-ff71-8112-4e55"},{"link_uuid":"03175aca-b193-42b7-9839-2be42729ce3f","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"59a7-cb88-f2f9-4148"},{"link_uuid":"e108df27-9438-439f-a263-328196118d8a","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"61c7-401f-9fd5-406f"},{"link_uuid":"b6755dc3-c8dd-496a-9ba3-62acd5881255","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"e057-1f93-5328-4c25"}],"description":"## Context\nThis replacement tree consolidates the retired 1,499-ticket per-file audit into six workstream stories and 117 path-disjoint remediation leaves. The leaves cover 1,514 distinct file-impact paths: 1,499 migrated paths plus 15 paths added without retired-source mappings. This epic makes no repository edits.\n\n## Plan\n- Complete and close every leaf through its recorded checks, independent semantic review, Gerrit gates, merge, and completion verification.\n- Close each workstream after it records the exact migration and execution inventories required by its plan.\n- Concatenate the six story migration TSVs, add `story-alias`, sort by path, and store the 1,499-row result in a dedicated `session_log` linked `relates_to` this epic. Schema: `path<TAB>story-alias<TAB>replacement-leaf-alias<TAB>source-ticket-alias<TAB>scope-count<TAB>file-impact-count`.\n- Concatenate the six story execution TSVs, add `story-alias`, sort by path, and store the 1,514-row result in the same log. Schema: `path<TAB>story-alias<TAB>replacement-leaf-alias<TAB>scope-count<TAB>file-impact-count<TAB>source-count`.\n- Record both row counts and SHA-256 values in the epic completion comment, together with the six story-log ids.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] All six workstream stories are closed.\n- [ ] All 117 remediation leaves are closed.\n- [ ] The epic migration TSV contains exactly 1,499 rows.\n- [ ] The migration TSV contains exactly 1,499 distinct migrated paths.\n- [ ] The migration TSV contains exactly 1,499 distinct retired source tickets.\n- [ ] Every retired source ticket has exactly one net-active live replacement leaf.\n- [ ] Every migration row has `scope-count=1`.\n- [ ] Every migration row has `file-impact-count=1`.\n- [ ] The epic execution TSV contains exactly 1,514 rows.\n- [ ] The execution TSV contains exactly 1,514 distinct paths.\n- [ ] Every execution row has `scope-count=1`.\n- [ ] Every execution row has `file-impact-count=1`.\n- [ ] Exactly 1,499 execution rows have `source-count=1`.\n- [ ] Exactly 15 execution rows have `source-count=0`.\n- [ ] Every migrated Scope constraint has a non-author `semantic-preservation=PASS` row with immutable before/final citations.\n- [ ] Every migrated consumer contract has a non-author `semantic-preservation=PASS` row with immutable before/final citations.\n- [ ] Every edited prose block has a non-author `bloat-removal=PASS` row.\n- [ ] Every recorded leaf verification command exits 0 at its cited commit.\n- [ ] Every leaf completion trail records its Gerrit Change-Id, `LLM-Review +1`, `Verified +1`, and zero unresolved comments.\n- [ ] Every leaf completion trail records Gerrit `MERGED` status and the exact merged commit reachable from `origin/main`.\n- [ ] The epic log records both combined TSVs and all six story-log ids.\n- [ ] The epic completion comment cites the epic log and records both row counts and both SHA-256 values.\n\n## Completion boundary\nClose this epic only after every descendant is closed and every inventory check above passes.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","59a7-cb88-f2f9-4148"],["relates_to","61c7-401f-9fd5-406f"],["relates_to","e057-1f93-5328-4c25"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"This container makes no repository edits directly. Its descendant group tickets hold the exact edit paths; their commits and completion comments are the implementation evidence.","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"3e32-a859-2153-4a1b","ticket_type":"epic","title":"Remediate bloated comments in related file groups","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["35a87d5e-445b-4bca-97d9-e887d6245b16","16964458-cc95-44f8-8fb4-736f9a5929e3","dd5c5725-7abb-4bc4-b3d1-8ec48c2c42a4","0ab2df07-6086-487d-a629-b6104320e873","03175aca-b193-42b7-9839-2be42729ce3f","e108df27-9438-439f-a263-328196118d8a","1e856045-b65b-4228-97c4-cef7f69103f4","1502cf93-573c-4a46-a663-b1fd7ffe95cb","d7bf50e2-bc67-4800-8c83-93ceb357a327","b172c770-15e8-4d46-99d9-d7235e82d2bf","b6755dc3-c8dd-496a-9ba3-62acd5881255"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788675504520097196,"uuid":"b6d54272-ec3e-4823-9019-9d7570b96bc5"}